.fi
.SH TESTING POLICY
Since October 2026, Smithproxy development follows a strict, documented testing
policy. Successful validation of a clean checkout can be published as a
commit-specific report containing the test profile, section results, selected
metrics and reproduction command. Reports and their publication rules are kept
under
.IR docs/test-reports/
in the source repository. A report applies to its recorded commit and profile;
it is not a blanket guarantee for other builds or environments.
